grid-rows: 2
grid-columns: 3
horizontal-gap: 190
vertical-gap: 130
board: "프로젝트 보드\n= 설계도"
issue: "이슈 1개\n= 작업 1개"
wt: "워크트리\n에이전트 작업"
done: "이슈 닫힘 = 도장\nCloses #N"
merge: "스쿼시 머지"
pr: "PR → CI\n통과"
board -> issue: "쪼개 등록"
issue -> wt
wt -> pr
pr -> merge
merge -> done
done -> board: "남은 칸 확인" {style.stroke-dash: 4}
board.style.stroke: "#ff00ff"

**.style.font-size: 34
(** -> **)[*].style.font-size: 26
